      "content": "it's just so heavy. everyone keeps telling me \"it gets better\" or \"start over,\" but they don't get it. there is no \"over there\" to go to. the person who was capable of succeeding, the person people actually respected... that person is dead. it feels more like a funeral than a setback. why even bother trying to stitch together pieces of a life that's clearly finished?",
